<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:55:38Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>COP31未能達成重大氣候協議，談判暴露出嚴重分歧</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4gn2l17w5go/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:55:30Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T05:15:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4gn2l17w5go/trad--dfbf51bf0d39.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4gn2l17w5go/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">最終的協議草案未能被歐盟、太平洋島國和其他國家接受，因為它沒有直接提及化石燃料，而化石燃料是全球暖化的主要原因。</summary></entry><entry><title>說唱歌手出身尼泊爾新總理首訪印度：如何平衡對華關係</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c64gn9jl5lveo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:55:32Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T00:09:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c64gn9jl5lveo/trad--6ddb573c32e0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c64gn9jl5lveo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">說唱歌手出身的尼泊爾新總理沙哈首訪印度，盼重啟關係並爭取山洪重建援助，但邊界爭議與經驗不足成考驗</summary></entry><entry><title>Anthropic公司或許已解決重大數學難題：黎曼猜想</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwe85gr487dno/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:55:36Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T00:10:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwe85gr487dno/trad--5f715a8024f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwe85gr487dno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Anthropic公司或許已解決重大數學難題：黎曼猜想</summary></entry><entry><title>以毒攻毒？道路安全研究人員找 《GTA》幫忙</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c8p3vdpxwk5xo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-22T06:19:03Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c8p3vdpxwk5xo/trad--90878552ed4d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c8p3vdpxwk5xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">《俠盜獵車手》（GTA）系列中，玩家駕車在虛構城市裡橫衝直撞、大肆破壞，本來就是遊戲樂趣之一。但研究人員卻有不同想法。</summary></entry><entry><title>你的孩子會說謊嗎？這或許並非壞事</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg2lyq7dxvo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:55:38Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T00:10:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg2lyq7dxvo/trad--2be70a328ee8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg2lyq7dxvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">父母可能會因為孩子撒謊而生氣，但專家解釋說，這是孩子人格成長的過程</summary></entry><entry><title>高雄選戰「知識藍」對決「新潮流」，國民黨能複製「韓流」嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6n4ex4y9837o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T16:25:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6n4ex4y9837o/trad--a43863954373.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6n4ex4y9837o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">柯志恩以「知識藍」的姿態拉攏中間選民，支持度大幅追貼深耕高雄20年的賴瑞隆，選情咬緊。</summary></entry><entry><title>「藍白合」示範區：新竹市選情如何透露台灣第三勢力的未來？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cme3d27d7lnpo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T09:49:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cme3d27d7lnpo/trad--f5d08918cba0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cme3d27d7lnpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">新竹市是民眾黨此前唯一贏得執政權的縣市，現任市長高虹安尋求連任，她這次雖已退出民眾黨、改以無黨籍身分參選，但學者指出其選情不僅將影響雙方未來合作模式能否延續，也可能牽動2028年全國大選的政治布局。</summary></entry><entry><title>九合一前夕：台灣幾乎年年選舉，會引起「投票疲勞」嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63egjkzqpz2o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T10:39:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63egjkzqpz2o/trad--7bd3a1bacef6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63egjkzqpz2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣在過去七年間，幾乎每年都有大型選舉、罷免或公投。有學者形容台灣政治人物常處於「選舉模式」，在面對不同議題時往往急於回應。</summary></entry><entry><title>「九合一」五大看點：「洋流」能否撼動台北？誰在卡位2028？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8xzrg40dq1o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T02:45:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8xzrg40dq1o/trad--4fc64a9bc6d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8xzrg40dq1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中共是否介入台灣選舉？ 這次選舉將如何影響賴清德與國民黨主席鄭麗文的政治能量？捲土重來、希望藉著地方議員選舉有所斬獲的小黨，此次結盟能否在主流政黨夾殺中突圍而出？</summary></entry><entry><title>APEC上與習近平、特朗普歷史性會晤，對普京是一場重大勝利</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq702kdw845ro/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-22T03:46:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq702kdw845ro/trad--12120a5a45a8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq702kdw845ro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">週四美國、中國和俄羅斯領導人的會晤將為普京（普丁）提供一個重要的舞台——但這並不會讓他離贏得烏克蘭戰爭更近一步。</summary></entry><entry><title>凱特王妃在BBC紀錄片《療癒》中談癌症如何改變了她</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crn4kj25vqlyo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-22T07:39:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crn4kj25vqlyo/trad--9e537bd50318.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crn4kj25vqlyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">凱特王妃在紀錄片的片段中說道。這部片記錄了她對疾病與康復過程的私人想法。</summary></entry><entry><title>菲律賓寵物火葬場醜聞：死去貓狗屍體出現在直播畫面中</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv62pjg5d533o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-22T08:57:48Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv62pjg5d533o/trad--2a56a0ccb69e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv62pjg5d533o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">許多傷心的菲律賓人面臨著一個令人痛心的現實：他們的寵物能並沒有得到應有的葬禮</summary></entry><entry><title>地球迎來新的「迷你月亮」——它並不孤單</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqy7rg0yyxxko/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-22T01:30:51Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqy7rg0yyxxko/trad--b0b8e06e974d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqy7rg0yyxxko/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">地球迎來新迷你衛星，體積極小且僅短暫繞行。同時存在準衛星與幽靈衛星等暫時天體，但皆遠不及月球，也無危險。</summary></entry><entry><title>從倉頡換成漢語拼音：電腦輸入法會影響下一代學習中文嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxq6e216p7ylo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T06:12:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxq6e216p7ylo/trad--737603724a9b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxq6e216p7ylo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港教育局提出小學二年級學生應該初步掌握以「漢語拼音輸入法」在電腦上輸入中文。打字方式的改變，會如何影響下一代學習語言？</summary></entry><entry><title>英國女子遭丈夫下藥，13年間被陌生男子輪流性侵</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx8dv4e080ldo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T09:24:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx8dv4e080ldo/trad--9c43fea94c64.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx8dv4e080ldo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">四名男子性侵一名被其丈夫下藥的女子，被裁定性侵罪成。</summary></entry><entry><title>中美俄元首峰會：從烏克蘭、伊朗、和平宣言到承諾核對話</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c38x04eppnpdo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T12:22:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c38x04eppnpdo/trad--998083d65242.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c38x04eppnpdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">會後發表的中俄美元首和平宣言顯示，三國領導人承諾就「減少核風險、防止核擴散」展開對話，並就聯合國改革、能源穩定和國際刑事法院管轄權等議題達成四點共識。</summary></entry><entry><title>APEC的特色服飾：從克林頓皮衣到深圳「鯤鵬展翅」絲巾</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmly7er4rze9o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T07:05:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmly7er4rze9o/trad--a3bd35f0ea40.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmly7er4rze9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在每一年的亞太經合組織峰會上，人們除了關心哪個國的領導人出席、他們之間的互動和談話，還有他們大合照時穿了什麼。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣「九合一」選舉：有哪些看點？藍綠勝負如何影響2028大選佈局？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3vyl0x1x6o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T15:55:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3vyl0x1x6o/trad--d8ec69c28835.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3vyl0x1x6o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">11月28日，台灣將舉行「九合一」地方選舉。BBC中文走訪台北、新北與高雄三大關鍵戰場，解析藍綠激戰、中間選民崛起，以及中國因素對選情的影響。這場選舉不只關乎地方治理，也可能為2028年總統大選定下基調。</summary></entry><entry><title>中美俄「三巨頭」會晤的台前幕後</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn0d4pnrj31o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T16:16:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn0d4pnrj31o/trad--4b4d8f07ee39.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn0d4pnrj31o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC記者從深圳帶你回顧這場中美俄「三巨頭」峰會的台前幕後。</summary></entry><entry><title>中美俄元首歷史性會晤 普京獲得外交勝利嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck9q84jgpxpjo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T17:24:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck9q84jgpxpjo/trad--5ab9b53bc3ae.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck9q84jgpxpjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國國家主席習近平、美國總統特朗普及俄羅斯總統普京在APEC深圳峰會期間舉行首次三方會談，聚焦烏克蘭危機與核軍控。</summary></entry><entry><title>從領導人合照到場邊會談：高市早苗的APEC外交觀察</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck782e5dxeygo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T10:20:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck782e5dxeygo/trad--659932d90b16.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck782e5dxeygo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">高市早苗在歡迎晚宴前與中國國家主席習近平握手，兩人短暫互動。不過，高市抵達深圳時的接待安排相對低調。</summary></entry><entry><title>無法複製的奇蹟？深圳如何從改革開放樣板到「中國矽谷」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmg46q2nl5n2o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-15T18:21:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmg46q2nl5n2o/trad--626e71e48e28.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmg46q2nl5n2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">深圳首次主辦亞太經濟合作組織（APEC）領導人峰會，成為中國的第三座主辦城市。深圳的崛起往往被視為中國改革開放最成功的一場實驗。而在中國和世界變幻莫測的今天，這個高速發展的奇蹟還能延續嗎？</summary></entry><entry><title>中美俄「三巨頭」坐在了一起，世界正滑向大國共管嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvglr9r243x6o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T00:11:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvglr9r243x6o/trad--34ff6da99463.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvglr9r243x6o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「他們能坐下來，就說明這個世界還沒有到第一次或第二次世界大戰那個狀況。」香港科技大學榮休教授丁學良對BBC說。</summary></entry><entry><title>「讓黃仁勳回歸」運動：輝達駁斥、特朗普支持恢復其CEO職位</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3rgq3l5yr1o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T07:20:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3rgq3l5yr1o/trad--b27dc602b96e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3rgq3l5yr1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">多位科技業領袖表態支持一項行動，要求這家AI晶片龍頭讓黃仁勳重返執行長職位。</summary></entry><entry><title>中美能源大戰如何影響你的帳單？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvg2er51z1wo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T01:45:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvg2er51z1wo/trad--bf8b484b78f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvg2er51z1wo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中美之間的博弈可能會對能源成本產生重大影響，但誰會最終獲勝？</summary></entry><entry><title>黃仁勳曾告訴我，那些關於中國與國家安全的問題</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm36gnenlj59o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T02:41:36Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm36gnenlj59o/trad--d34e970c53e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm36gnenlj59o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">黃仁勳正因涉嫌與一名中國間諜出軌而接受調查，他對世界秩序的未來遠比其他科技巨頭老闆重要得多。</summary></entry><entry><title>DeepSeek被美國政府系統禁用：中美AI競爭繼續升溫</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T07:42:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad--c79590262ebf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">DeepSeek的免費聊天機器人應用程式在Apple App Store下載排行榜上名列前茅，其AI模型也被美國科技企業採用。Snowflake、Vercel及OpenRouter等公司都已將DeepSeek整合至其提供給客戶的服務中。</summary></entry><entry><title>「台灣乾爹」光環崩塌：黃仁勳事件如何震動產業、政治與社會？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn80j39wq06o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T09:51:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn80j39wq06o/trad--d4f113586173.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn80j39wq06o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">黃仁勳光速跌落神壇的事件，讓台灣社會對他的崇拜、政治對他的政績綁定，以及產業對他個人的依賴重新校準。</summary></entry><entry><title>緬甸種族滅絕裁決影響深遠的歷史意義</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5n4eylmmg8po/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T08:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5n4eylmmg8po/trad--c5b0031236ad.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5n4eylmmg8po/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC國際編輯寫道，律師將研究岡比亞如何證明緬甸意圖實施種族滅絕。</summary></entry><entry><title>「中國間諜案」獲撤控男子BBC專訪：我是情報部門的替罪羊</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9d71qne5p9o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T13:43:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9d71qne5p9o/trad--37d4f7a5dd1d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9d71qne5p9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC取得並查閱的數千則訊息顯示，一名中國官員曾設法了解多項敏感政治事務的內情。</summary></entry><entry><title>從科技巨星到跌落神壇——黃仁勳如何深陷醜聞漩渦？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3wgp60p952o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T16:14:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3wgp60p952o/trad--8060ccd97f8e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3wgp60p952o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">短短幾天內，黃仁勳作為全球科技競賽領軍人物、看似無可撼動的地位便迅速崩塌。</summary></entry><entry><title>從局長下台到議會「沉默」 宏福苑大火後的政治問責與維穩邏輯</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0e0e7d7qv4o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T01:03:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0e0e7d7qv4o/trad--126982746c97.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0e0e7d7qv4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC中文採訪多名政治分析人士，拆解這場善後操作背後所反映的維穩管治邏輯，以及又與即將舉行的選委會及特首選舉有何深層連結。</summary></entry><entry><title>里長赴中旅遊受關注：為何北京鎖定里長？里長怎麼看？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3elx8gxdn3o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-16T09:03:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3elx8gxdn3o/trad--590a4fb67825.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3elx8gxdn3o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣地方選舉即將到來，近年北京對台統戰工作重心從政商菁英轉向基層社會，而里長作為選舉期間的地方「樁腳」，就成為了北京的重要接觸對象。</summary></entry><entry><title>里長赴中旅遊：台灣《反滲透法》為何「查辦多、定罪少」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr7428z1wx74o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-16T09:03:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr7428z1wx74o/trad--8a4ed0fe3aa1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr7428z1wx74o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣「九合一」地方選舉進入倒數，北京試圖介入台灣選舉的相關活動再受關注。台灣《反滲透法》施行後，儘管近年相關案件數量快速增加，但查辦近600人，只有5人被定罪，使現行法律規範與執法標準受到外界檢視。</summary></entry><entry><title>BBC調查揭英國「全球人才簽證」造假產業：中介助移民冒充藝術家及科技專才</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw4gn0mgz1m3o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T08:27:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw4gn0mgz1m3o/trad--04598e34d87a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw4gn0mgz1m3o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC臥底調查揭露一場精心策劃的騙局，協助富裕移民透過快速通道取得英國永久居留權。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國人如何背棄特朗普——2026中期大選結果覆盤</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/resources/idt-eb5702ee-a7ac-4445-8942-456df0e95f0f#6</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T00:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/resources/idt-eb5702ee-a7ac-4445-8942-456df0e95f0f--393d86e5dbaa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/resources/idt-eb5702ee-a7ac-4445-8942-456df0e95f0f?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">九張圖表解釋民主黨在美國中期選舉中的壓倒性勝利，以及這對總統意味著甚麼。</summary></entry><entry><title>從蔡康永、《VIVANT》到姆巴佩，北京為何區別處理「辱華」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T00:21:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad--c99d6f3ad72f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">最近幾週，中國輿論場接連出現多宗被貼上「辱華」標籤的爭議事件：台灣藝人蔡康永、日本電視劇《VIVANT》以及法國球星姆巴佩。三宗事件看似性質相近，但官方反應與輿論熱度卻明顯不同，多位分析人士對BBC中文指出：這些差異背後是當局對於每個事件的定性並不相同。</summary></entry><entry><title>羅伯·派汀森：《暮光之城》男主角如何成為007</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c893rgw9zrxqo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T02:38:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c893rgw9zrxqo/trad--03fa8a167e7c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c893rgw9zrxqo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">羅伯·派汀森（Robert Pattinson）早已在《暮光之城》系列、《蝙蝠俠》和《奧德賽》等電影，奠定了自己作為男主角、動作明星及演員的地位。如今，他接下詹姆士·龐德（James Bond；占士邦）一角，將使他的知名度更上一層樓。</summary></entry><entry><title>身體最常受傷、卻很少人會刻意鍛鍊的部位：腳踝</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwj05r347d0lo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T00:29:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwj05r347d0lo/trad--c5f5a8d6cf18.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwj05r347d0lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">運動物理治療師珍妮薇芙·陶亞（Genevieve Tawiah）分享了她護理關節的秘訣；關節問題佔急診就診量的 5%。</summary></entry><entry><title>「你甚至不會告訴密友」：分娩後遺症，為何多年後仍揮之不去？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwr7grvx00yxo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T08:33:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwr7grvx00yxo/trad--b1eb3b049467.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwr7grvx00yxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從失禁到長期疼痛，數以百萬計的女性在分娩數十年後仍然飽受後遺症困擾。</summary></entry><entry><title>父母選擇「雙人安樂死」，留下我獨自承受喪親之痛</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5yn1y6v0lno/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T06:32:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5yn1y6v0lno/trad--0dd0092810ad.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5yn1y6v0lno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">簡和埃爾斯在幸福地生活了50年後，選擇接受安樂死，留下了他們唯一的孩子。</summary></entry><entry><title>「短睡眠基因」：為何有人只需睡四小時？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0j0341z50qo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-23T07:54:29Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T02:59:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0j0341z50qo/trad--f832ffff66be.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm0j0341z50qo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一般成年人平均需要七至九小時睡眠，但有些人確實只需極少睡眠也能維持良好狀態。</summary></entry></feed>
